  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [bel](https://github.com/shama/bel) from `v5.1.3` to `v5.1.5`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>shama/bel</summary>\n\n#### 5.1.5\n-   [`903bf5e`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/903bf5e4209beb3c33a6acb9f52c6ed533875831) 5.1.5\n-   [`a9c34ff`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/a9c34ffe34182a20eae99f26e8686b5d03fa3026) bump pelo\n#### 5.1.4\n-   [`3ad7612`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/3ad7612b1498413310ad96fbe917baa5f63584c9) 5.1.4\n-   [`d6c9b65`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/d6c9b6538d420688aad191ab38829e9f015c76fd) Added ^ (caret) for pelo dependency (#&#8203;97)\n-   [`f52dc39`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/f52dc39b413dc30276533617489185bc6886acc5) Merge pull request #&#8203;96 from IzumiSy/add_types_in_package_json\n-   [`c770d9c`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/c770d9c4aacb30f72be51a28e0c6769642796493) Add types field in package.json\n-   [`4427c17`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/4427c170467d85732f40e1587217c74dc1f2714d) Merge pull request #&#8203;95 from IzumiSy/typing_for_spread_operator\n-   [`f522021`](https://github.com/shama/bel/commit/f522021942ab8f4b993543e16a2bffe7b6f3a2f4) Add explicit any type for &#x27;keys&#x27;\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
